+    /* A forced settle answers every report the backend has taken -- but the
+     * backend can be far behind the walker: loading Silox (run fix5e) 1,884
+     * reports were still in its queue behind ~1,800 texture uploads, unchanged
+     * across two firings 50 ms apart. A count that has not moved for 2 s of
+     * firings is reports the backend will never answer (it drops ZPASS
+     * commands before its batches are up): forget them, or the hold stays
+     * armed for good. */
