+ * guest range and log every access the guard catches -- any width, vector
+ * loads and host copies included, which the PPU/SPU watches do not see --
+ * with the thread, the host instruction and its guest function. A watcher
+ * thread re-arms the guard every millisecond (a guard fires once) and prints
