+ * NV4097_SET_ZPASS_PIXEL_COUNT_ENABLE (0x17CC) counts the samples that pass the
+ * depth test, CLEAR_REPORT_VALUE(1) (0x17C8) zeroes the count, GET_REPORT(1,
