+ * (2 << 24 | offset) draws only while that report is non-zero ((1 << 24): draw
+ * always). Into the Nexus hides its lens flares that way: a test box per light,
+ * then the flare drawn on that condition. The runtime answered every query
+ * "visible", so every flare drew through walls (owner, 0.1 test build).
